menu "ADS-B Radar"

    config ADSB_RADAR_ETH
        bool "Bring up Ethernet + web server after boot"
        default y
        help
            Starts the onboard 100M Ethernet (P4 internal EMAC + IP101GRI RMII
            PHY) with a DHCP client and serves the radar web UI over the wired
            network. Requires the Ethernet cable to be connected and a DHCP
            server on the LAN.

endmenu